{"screen_name": "0kaka_riceball", "file": "0kaka_riceball", "name": "0nigiri0kaka", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1612668558219304960/KA0qBu5A.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1300401091666821120/1673325120/1500x500", "description": "不定期に浮上。RP中心。規制前に世界情勢など気になる情報を集める雑多垢/転載,AI学習等への使用禁止Do not repost or use my works. No Gen AI", "total_works": 48, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 10000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 10000, "max": 10000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/0kaka_riceball", "name": "0kaka_riceball"}, {"label": "SKIMA", "url": "https://skima.jp/profile?id=182475", "name": "182475"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@0kaka_riceball/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e9dcbcf/uploads/origins/2483d6ca-8e4a-490a-9e26-e1afbcd2ad47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bececb44c1fb9eb7c435e54e5a93d42", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e9dcbcf/uploads/origins/2483d6ca-8e4a-490a-9e26-e1afbcd2ad47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bececb44c1fb9eb7c435e54e5a93d42, https://si.imgix.net/4e9dcbcf/uploads/origins/2483d6ca-8e4a-490a-9e26-e1afbcd2ad47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2206c17e72a03d2548d4c29a4574d561 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e9dcbcf/uploads/origins/2483d6ca-8e4a-490a-9e26-e1afbcd2ad47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c40341c14fef73b5ff570a53b81c925b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつもお世話になっております！\n先日はありがとうございました！！\n\n今回はいつもお願いさせて頂いてる、\n女の子の方のイラストをリクエストさせていただきます。\n\n【キャラクター】\nいつものピンクの髪色の女の子でお願いします。\n（参考までに過去に作成していただいたイラストを以下に貼ります）\nhttps://www.dropbox.co